# ⚙️ 3. Make it production-grade (this is where most projects fail)

Right now it’s a demo. Make it a **product**:

### Must-haves:

* 🔐 Authentication (Firebase/Auth0/JWT)
* ☁️ Deployment (very important)

  * AWS / Render / Vercel
* 🗄️ Persistent vector DB

  * Pinecone or Supabase
* 📂 File storage (S3 / Supabase storage)

### Add:

* Rate limiting
* Error handling
* Logging

👉 Recruiters LOVE deployed apps
(no deploy = instant downgrade)

