# 📊 5. Add evaluation & metrics (this is elite-level)

Almost nobody does this — which is why you should.

### Add:

* Accuracy testing
* Response time (latency)
* Token usage
* Compare:

  * different chunk sizes
  * different models

Example:

```
Chunk size: 500 → Accuracy: 78%
Chunk size: 1000 → Accuracy: 85%
```

👉 This screams: “engineer, not just builder”

